                                "sense_id": "5399c883-efaa-3c44-b85a-681f9467b832",
                                "text": "Without prejudice against Urton's argument that khipus are theoretically capable of lexigraphic reference such as logosyllabography, I have found that actual cord lexigraphy remains conjectural."
                            }
